WEBVTT

00:02:01.784 --> 00:02:04.036
But here's the good news.

00:02:04.871 --> 00:02:06.914
It doesn't have to be this way.

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.959
Because the same thing
that is holding people back

00:02:10.001 --> 00:02:13.129
can be used to help
move them forward to safe refuge:

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:16.132
the rule of law.

00:02:17.133 --> 00:02:21.387
The key is to get legal knowledge
into the hands of those who need it most

00:02:21.429 --> 00:02:24.140
and give them a chance to use the law

00:02:24.182 --> 00:02:28.060
to open pathways to safety
for themselves and their families.

00:02:29.187 --> 00:02:32.481
Although there's an entire industry
built around humanitarian aid